+    // Engine.agree's settings part, composed as it calls it: the settings text (`Settings`, every field), the draft
+    // cut's, the wide unembed's and the shared cut's switches (settingsHash), then the kernels' launch choices
+    // (hashLaunchChoices), then the prompt chunks' overlap and codes (xover.hashSettings), each read from this process's
